*** Keywords ***
General_SiSo_Auto_PUCCH_Performance_Test_Admin
    [Documentation]         PUCCH Performance Test for both TDD and FDD radios.
    ...                     Admin API version differs from selenium ones by two arguments newly introduced in 23R2:
    ...                        - act_high_speed_cell: bool
    ...                        - digital_output_enable: bool
    ...                     digital_output_enable becomes the mandatory param, thus test won't work on older releases.
    ...                     Parameter version_of_test_validation: int describes which QC test version is running. Default 3 means
    ...                     test will validate result according to [3.0] QC version. For [2.0] QC version, param value should be equal 2.
    ...                     For TDD radios "nrarfcn" param is replaced and should be passed as "nrarfcn_ul".
    ...                     Parameter beam_id can be provided as integer or list of integers, each value in range <0 to 1200>, default 0.
    ...                     Number of list elements depends on scf configuration and should be equal to numberOfRxBeamforming / 2.
    [Arguments]                                        ${cell_id}
    ...                                                ${pucch_format}
    ...                                                ${beam_id}=0
    ...                                                ${receiving_slot}=1023
    ...                                                ${expectation_slot}=341
    ...                                                ${rep_time_int}=1
    ...                                                ${ru_mode}=NR_Only
    ...                                                ${ul_slots}=${None}
    ...                                                ${prb_offset}=0
    ...                                                ${largest_prb_index}=0
    ...                                                ${num_pucch_symbol}=1
    ...                                                ${num_payload_bit}=1
    ...                                                ${pucch_payload_content}=0
    ...                                                ${format3_additional_dmrs}=Disabled
    ...                                                ${act_high_speed_cell}=${False}
    ...                                                ${digital_output_enable}=${True}
    ...                                                ${version_of_test_validation}=3
    ...                                                ${timeout}=60
    ...                                                ${admin_test_name}=NR_CONTROL
    [Timeout]                                          24 hours

    Create admin session with default alias
    ${connection}                                      connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ${cell_dist_names}  ${physical_cell_id}            Get Cell Info for Performance Test
    ...                                                config_nr_cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    ${technology_type}                                 admin_info_model.get_cell_technology
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    ...                                                cell_type=nr
    ...                                                cell_id=${cell_id}
    ${ul_slots}                  run keyword if        '${ul_slots}'=='${None}'
    ...                                                tm_setup_adm.get_default_ul_slots_value
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    ...                                                cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                          ELSE                  set variable
    ...                                                ${ul_slots}
    &{nrarfcn}=                                        tm_setup_adm.get_nrafcn_variables_for_nr_cell_id
    ...                                                cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    ...                                                sep_channels_for_tdd=${True}

    config_operations.connect                          alias=${connection}
    ${scs}=                                            config_operations.get_parameter_value
    ...                                                dist_name=${cell_dist_names["configuration"]}
    ...                                                param_name=ssbScs

    ${beam_pattern_id}                                 tm_startup.prepare_beam_id_parameter
    ...                                                ${beam_id}

    Robot log operation                                Starting NR PUCCH ${pucch_format} performance test...
    ${start_test_result}                               nr_conformance_adm.start_5g_pucch_performance_test
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    ...                                                cell_dist_name=${cell_dist_names["run_time"]}
    ...                                                interval=${rep_time_int}
    ...                                                beam_pattern_id=${beam_pattern_id}
    ...                                                receiving_slot=${receiving_slot}
    ...                                                expectation_slot=${expectation_slot}
    ...                                                pucch_format=${pucch_format}
    ...                                                ru_mode=${ru_mode}
    ...                                                phys_cell_id=${physical_cell_id}
    ...                                                nrarfcn_ul=${nrarfcn['nrarfcn_uplink']}
    ...                                                nrarfcn_dl=${nrarfcn['nrarfcn_downlink']}
    ...                                                prb_offset=${prb_offset}
    ...                                                largest_prb_index=${largest_prb_index}
    ...                                                num_pucch_symbol=${num_pucch_symbol}
    ...                                                num_payload_bit=${num_payload_bit}
    ...                                                pucch_payload_content=${pucch_payload_content}
    ...                                                format3_additional_dmrs=${format3_additional_dmrs}
    ...                                                act_high_speed_cell=${act_high_speed_cell}
    ...                                                digital_output_enable=${digital_output_enable}
    ...                                                timeout=${timeout}

    Should Be Equal As Strings                         ${start_test_result['status']}
    ...                                                Succeeded
    ...                                                msg=NR PUCCH ${pucch_format} test start failed: ${start_test_result['msg']}

    Check If Test Model Is Active                      admin_test_name=${admin_test_name}
    ...                                                cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                connection=${connection}

    ${admin_test_results}                              Get Results from Performance Test
    ...                                                cell_dist_name=${cell_dist_names["run_time"]}
    ...                                                test_name=PUCCH
    ...                                                connection=${connection}

    ${part_results}  ${cumu_results}  ${test_results}  Reformat Performance Test Results
    ...                                                performance_test_type=PUCCH
    ...                                                admin_test_results=${admin_test_results}
    ...                                                cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                rep_time_interval=${rep_time_int}
    ...                                                ul_slots=${ul_slots}
    ...                                                nrarfcn_ul=${nrarfcn['nrarfcn_uplink']}

    Validate PUCCH Performance Tables Results          WebUI_cumu_res_table=${cumu_results}
    ...                                                WebUI_part_res_table=${part_results}
    ...                                                WebUI_test_res_table=${test_results}
    ...                                                test_format=${pucch_format}
    ...                                                expectation_slot=${expectation_slot}
    ...                                                reception_slot=${receiving_slot}
    ...                                                technology_type=${technology_type}
    ...                                                scs=${scs}
    ...                                                num_payload_bit=${num_payload_bit}
    ...                                                number_of_pucch_symbol=${num_pucch_symbol}
    ...                                                version=${version_of_test_validation}

    [Teardown]                                         Terminate PUCCH Performance Test
    ...                                                cell_dist_name=${cell_dist_names["run_time"]}
    ...                                                test_name=${pucch_format}
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    ...                                                timeout=${timeout}

Terminate PUCCH Performance Test
    [Documentation]         Stops currently running performance test via admin API.
    [Arguments]                                        ${cell_dist_name}
    ...                                                ${test_name}
    ...                                                ${connection}
    ...                                                ${timeout}
    Robot log operation                                Stopping NR PUCCH ${test_name} performance test...
    ${stop_test_result}                                nr_conformance_adm.stop_5g_performance_test
    ...                                                connection=${connection}
    ...                                                cell_dist_name=${cell_dist_name}
    ...                                                test_name=${test_name}
    ...                                                timeout=${timeout}
    Should Be Equal As Strings                         ${stop_test_result['status']}
    ...                                                Succeeded
    ...                                                msg=NR PUCCH ${test_name} test stop failed: ${stop_test_result['msg']}
    Check If Any Test Model Is Active                  connection=${connection}
    ...                                                should_be_active=${False}
